---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Our Story"
  description="From a local herbal processing facility in 1986 to a global botanical extracts supplier. Discover the ZL Botanicals journey of growth, innovation, and excellence."
  lang={lang}
  heroTitle="Our Story"
  heroSubtitle="From humble beginnings to global reach"
>
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-4xl">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">The Beginning (1986)</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          In the lush hills of Zhenlong township, Guangzhou, where medicinal herbs have been cultivated for centuries, ZL Botanicals was officially established. Our founders combined generations of herbal knowledge with a vision to share China's botanical treasures with the world.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Growth & Modernization (1990s-2000s)</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          We invested heavily in modern extraction technology while preserving traditional knowledge. Our facility expanded to accommodate growing demand, and we achieved our first international quality certifications.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Global Expansion (2007-Present)</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Renamed ZL Botanicals, we expanded our vision to serve the global market. Today, we partner with companies across 50+ countries, delivering premium botanical ingredients for the food, beverage, nutraceutical, and cosmetic industries.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Today</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          With 7 GMP-certified production lines, 24,000 m² of facility space, and the capacity to process over 20,000 tons of raw materials annually, we continue our mission: bringing the best of nature to the world.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
